# Allowlist: the perception service image (src/medomni/perception/sidecar/Dockerfile) gets exactly what it COPYs.
# BuildKit reads that Dockerfile's own Dockerfile.dockerignore; the legacy builder reads this file.
*
!perception
!pyproject.toml
!src/medomni/__init__.py
!src/medomni/core
!src/medomni/perception
!core/families
# inside the allowed trees: never ship runtime state
perception/var
**/__pycache__
